qt5 requires a locally prepared source tarball before running slkbuild.

From this directory, run:

    ./fetch_sources.sh

This script clones the Qt 5.15 source tree and creates the expected
qt-everywhere-src-5.15.3_20220318_e507d3e5.tar.lz tarball.

After the tarball is present, build the package with:

    fakeroot slkbuild -X

The SLKBUILD does not fetch sources on its own.
